For a model \eqn{M_0} nested inside a model \eqn{M_1}, with
\eqn{p_0 < p_1}, the statistic reported in the \code{Chisq} column is

\deqn{LR = 2 \left\{ \ell_1(\hat\theta_1) - \ell_0(\hat\theta_0) \right\},}

